# A label on a choice names whichever alternative matched; when an
# alternative has several elements there is no one value to record, so
# the label is an error (not dropped for that alternative).
# error: schema_label_several.grammar:27:19:
# error: label 'eq' names a choice with an alternative of several elements
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    integer
    plus
    colon
    comma
    eq
    eof
    err
'+'                                         → plus
':'                                         → colon
','                                         → comma
'='                                         → eq
[0-9]+                                      → integer
[a-z]+                                      → ident
.                                           → err

@parser
@schema
    t name:leaf | eq
top! = name:IDENT eq:("=" | COLON EQ)       → (t)
